 |                                             | Only logger in user can create etc. posts and comments | Edit if creator         | Edit if creator                    |
 |                                             |                                                        | Delete if creator       | Delete if creator or owner of post |
 
+### Webhooks
+
+Users can register outbound webhooks from their profile page. Each webhook subscribes to one post event (`post.created`, `post.edited`, `post.removed`) and receives a JSON payload when that event occurs. Deliveries are queued in the database and sent by a background worker.
+
 ### Simple usage instructions
 
 1. Click `profile` icon at footer > signup > enter email and password > changes to login modal > enter email and password used to signup
